==Battleground==
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*8 [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mukyakin (Enemy)|Mukyakin]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Hikakin (Enemy)|Hikakins]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Hikakin (Enemy)|Hikakins]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

